// # ooverify package
//
// Logline: Stock catalog package for ooverify.
//
// Setup: Folder shape is manifest plus payload. Do not import ooverify.oo from this file.
//
// Beats:
//   1. manifest — name, version, caps, sha256 of ooverify.oo.
